                <pb facs="0645" n="595" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg595"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your No. 193, 23d ultimo; have you received Caroline indemnity?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
